# Context

## Background
The Looper controller that develops this repository writes
per-task check logs under looper_<hash>/<task>/ beside the
worktree it verifies. Two such directories (t072, t078) were
committed by the self-run controller on 2026-11-14/15.

## Why This Way
Forward removal only. The logs hold make-check output with no
private content, so no history rewrite is warranted.

## Gotchas
- The looper repository already ignores looper_*/; this tree
  now matches that rule.
- Refs under refs/looper/ are internal controller state and
  must not be pushed to origin.
